  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "1. **Analyze the Variables:** Look at the `cargoQueue` array (the crates waiting) and `maxCapacity` (the safety limit).\r\n2. **Consult your AI Tutor:** Use the prompt below to ask how to write a `while` loop that checks *two* conditions at once (weight limit AND array length).\r\n3. **Write the Loop:** Implement the loop so it adds `cargoQueue[i]` to `currentWeight`. **Crucial:** You must include `i++` inside the loop or the page will freeze!\r\n4. **Verify Safety:** Run the code. Does the final weight stop near 500kg? If it goes way over or crashes, check your loop condition.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
